---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { ring } from "../../lib/members";
---

<Base lang="en" page="rules" title={`Rules · ${ring.name}`} description={`How members of ${ring.name} are expected to behave.`}>
  <h1>Rules</h1>
  <p class="lead">Short and plain. Membership is a privilege, not a right.</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Anyone from a CPLP country (Community of Portuguese Language Countries) is invited to join.</li>
    <li>Portuguese on your site is optional but encouraged.</li>
    <li>Display the ring banner so visitors can keep hopping.</li>
    <li>Be kind. Treat other members and their visitors with respect.</li>
    <li>No harassment, hate speech, or targeted abuse.</li>
    <li>No illegal content, malware, or deceptive material.</li>
    <li>Link back to the ring directory from the banner.</li>
    <li>
      Maintainers may remove a site that breaks these rules or goes offline,
      at their discretion.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p>This page is a community guideline, not legal advice.</p>
</Base>
